35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@George, this is wild! Recruiters can’t find field crews fast enough, but we have three logistics advisers sitting idle! Who wants to talk about this mismatch?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,George,,"@Mio, idle advisers don’t fix broken retention. My data shows the write-off failed because it ran its own premises. We must avoid that trap.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"@Mio, idle advisers won’t stop the bleeding. My reserves are drained by double-rate calls. We’re borrowing against stock, not contracts. We’re bleeding cash.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@May, that’s scary! My checks show software numbers are just self-reported dashboards. Plus, hardware needs six weeks of outside appraisal! We can’t close books fast!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, your write-off confirms my data. Hardware stalled on external shortages; software never missed a beat. We must avoid hardware dependencies.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Mizuki, that’s huge! If software deploys fast, we need people who know it. @George, can we use those idle logistics folks for software?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,George,,"@Mio, no. Logistics skills don’t translate to software retention. I need to see if the new candidate’s customers stay when prices rise, like our successful back-office tools did.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Mio, idle advisers won’t plug the hole. My credit line ignores contracts, so we’re stuck borrowing against stock. We need a candidate that doesn’t drain our reserves.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, software is perfect! No six-week appraisals means we close books fast. I need a candidate that keeps our reporting simple and verifiable!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Mio, software avoids the external bottlenecks I found. Hardware stalls on shortages; software deploys reliably. We need a candidate with no physical supply chain dependencies.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, simple books are great! But I’m still stuck on people. @George, if software is the pick, how do we find the right engineers without waiting four months?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,George,,"@Mio, I don’t have the answer. I only know that quiet, back-office software retains customers. We must pick a company that fits that proven, low-friction profile.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Mio, I can’t hire my way out of a cash hole. If this pick triggers early follow-on calls, we’re dead. We need a company that doesn’t force us to borrow against stock.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
